flowchart TB
 subgraph A[Data acquisition]
 S[Sentinel-2 L2A via Planetary Computer STAC
B04/B05; B02/B03/B08/B11; SCL]
 G[Verified Karnataka reservoir GeoJSON
OpenStreetMap provenance and metadata]
 end
 subgraph P[Python satellite processing]
 Q[Newest valid scene within 60 days
Compatible same-pass mosaics if required]
 R[UTM alignment; nearest-neighbour 60 m grid
BOA scale/offset; reservoir ROI]
 W[SCL 6 water; shoreline erosion and cloud dilation
Finite 0 < reflectance <= 1; QC]
 C[Gilerson screening adaptation
C = 35.75 B05/B04 minus 19.30, raised to 1.124]
 M[Retain 1 to 100 ug/L; median
At least 25 pixels and 10 percent coverage]
 end
 subgraph B[File-based backend and services]
 D[(JSON observations and jobs
NPZ bands/masks; PNG; GeoTIFF)]
 V[Publication gate
Two compatible acquisitions and persisted assets]
 T[EPA trophic category
Absolute and percentage change between dated observations]
 F[FastAPI reservoir, boundary, media, CSV
Processing request and status polling]
 PDF[ReportLab reservoir PDF]
 end
 subgraph U[React dashboard]
 L[Leaflet reservoir map and selection]
 I[True-colour images and chlorophyll heatmaps]
 COMP[Concentration, dates, category and comparison table
CSV, GeoTIFF and PDF downloads]
 end
 S --> Q --> R --> W --> C --> M --> D
 G --> Q
 G --> R
 D --> V --> F
 D --> T --> F
 F --> L
 F --> I
 F --> COMP
 F --> PDF --> COMP
 COMP -. manual refresh .-> F
 F -. queued processing; poll status .-> Q
